surprise <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> for me it would be<br /> <br /> Szechenyi Jol\u00e1n (Tzimisce)<br /> Justine Chen (Toreador)<br /> Cairo (Ravnos)<br /> <br /> especially Cairo, I can't be at peace until they tell me if she's alive or dead</div> </div> </div> </div>There's quite a few of the Montreal packs I'd like to know more about, we get a little in Beckett's Jyhad Diary but only about the main players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24869-zorin001","name":"Zorin001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-22T15:29:00-07:00","id":1326821,"title":"","content":"I would also like to know what Goratrix is doing, assuming he survived and is active. And I am interested in Vykos, and what he is doing after being (somewhat) freed of the Founder and Dracon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-22T18:01:57-07:00","id":1326840,"title":"","content":"* The Second Generation<br /> * The Third Generation<br /> * Minos<br /> * Altamira<br /> * Josua Cambridge<br /> * Sebastian Wolcott<br /> * Rachel Evans<br /> * Cohn Rose<br /> <br /> ... just for starters.<br /> <br /> UPDATE: And all the ones I'm working on for my own games; it would be great if someone ELSE would do all my work for me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13136-legendre","name":"Legendre","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"328"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-22T18:05:45-07:00","id":1326841,"title":"","content":"* Ayisha from the Red List because I love anyone who mass produces Noddist literature.<br /> <br /> * Monica Black the childe of Marcus Vitel.<br /> <br /> * What Marcus Vitel is up to now himself.<br /> <br /> * Anatole<br /> <br /> * Isaac Abrams, Damsel, and other Bloodlines NPCs.<br /> <br /> * Kirsten Bellamy","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-22-2019, 09:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-22T19:05:27-07:00","id":1326853,"title":"","content":"Alessio Rinaldi, he is just so interesting but all we get about him is a profile in the Malkavian Clanbook.<br /> <br /> Edit: I very much like to hear more about Italian Kindred Society that isn't narrowed down to &quot;Giovanni here, keep out.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12561,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","user":"Shawarbaaz","date":". 07-22-2019, 10:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T08:20:41-07:00","id":1326971,"title":"","content":"Callisti &amp; Callisto / Prince Alexandra, Inconnu of millennia old according to Rebekah (Children of the Night and Clanbook Toreador)<br /> <br /> Balthazar, the Ventrue methuselah (Dark Ages Companion)<br /> <br /> Boukephos, specially on how he died in the Sabbat crusade on the east coast<br /> <br /> Augustin, sire of Calebros, how he managed to meet the Inconnu (Clan Novel Nosferatu)<br /> <br /> Yima, the uncursed Nosferatu (LS4)<br /> <br /> Lady Regina Blake, childe of Victoria Ash (Victorian Age Trilogy)<br /> <br /> Djavakhi, sire of Noriz (Dark Ages Tzimisce novel)<br /> <br /> &quot;Ruthven&quot; or Lambach Ruthven, 4th generation childe of the Eldest<br /> <br /> The Black Mother / Marizhavashti Kali, childe of Dracian who resides in southern France (Clanbook Ravnos revised)<br /> <br /> Amaravati, childe of al-Ashrad (Clanbook Assamite revised)<br /> <br /> Enheduanna, grandsire of Drenis (Lair of the Hidden) historical figure, the first known author in the world, daughter of Sargon of Akkad<br /> <br /> &quot;The Dead Man&quot;, childe of Constancia, resides in New Orleans IIRC (Clan Novel Giovanni)<br /> <br /> Diego Giovanni, 6th generation Giovanni (Clanbook Giovanni revised)<br /> <br /> Astrid Thomas, childe of Etrius (Encyclopaedia Vampirica)<br /> <br /> Lucidus, he beat Tremere when they were both mages (House of Tremere)<br /> <br /> Pard, sire of Arnulf, probably among the eldest Gangrel around (Transylvania by Night, Clanbook Gangrel revised)<br /> <br /> The Widows pack from Montreal by Night.<br /> <br /> And many more, but this are the one I'm most interested in.<br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1594,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","user":"Saga","date":". 07-23-2019, 11:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T09:32:32-07:00","id":1326983,"title":"","content":"All the ancients but mainly:<br /> <br /> Ur-shulgi. I want to know if he is the unnamed baali. I also want to know more about his relationship with Haqim. Is Ur-shulgi really his herald or is he full of shit? Did he eat Haqim? Or maybe he is Haqim! Lots of stories could be told around their relationship.<br /> <br /> Haqim. There are a lot of mysteries around this guy. i would love to know more about him.<br /> <br /> Enoch. I want to know what happend after he got releases in BJD. Could he be the one behind the Beckoning?<br /> <br /> Saulot. I want to know to more about his plan to awaken Caine as mentionend in BJD. Is he friend or foe of Caine? What's his endgame plan?<br /> <br /> Caine. Is he real or just a myth? And if he is real what has he been up to all this time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24527-blackshade","name":"blackshade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T09:44:24-07:00","id":1326987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackshade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1326983#post1326983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Caine. Is he real or just a myth? And if he is real what has he been up to all this time.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't be surprised if we find out Caine is not the first vampire but just the first vampire to organize things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T10:43:45-07:00","id":1327008,"title":"","content":"As most elders traveled to Asia in V5, I hope to see current backgrounds to Suleiman ibn Abdullah (Lasombra founder of the Ashirra), Sophoniba (Sultan of Tunisia) and her enigmatic sire, who could probably be a childer of Enimachia (it supposedly being childe of Michael the Patriarch or be Salianna herself, who was quite forgotten after Dark Ages: Vampire).<br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T11:10:24-07:00","id":1327018,"title":"","content":"A mix of individual bloodline members. There has been a tendency to publish bloodlines as a concept, then neglect to present canon npcs belonging to them.<br /> <br /> Where are the Old Clan Tzimisce? Molochim? Danava? Noiad?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11558-nosimplehiway","name":"Nosimplehiway","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11558_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T11:35:59-07:00","id":1327022,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nosimplehiway</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327018#post1327018\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A mix of individual bloodline members. There has been a tendency to publish bloodlines as a concept, then neglect to present canon npcs belonging to them.<br /> <br /> Where are the Old Clan Tzimisce? Molochim? Danava? Noiad?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The first Old Clan Tzimisce appeared in Caine's Chosen: The Black Hand. The molochim is not a bloodline but a lineage of the Baali, who are descended from Moloch, one of the three Baali progenitors. One Danava NPC appear in V20s Dark Ages Companion section of &quot;The Domain of Mangaluru&quot;. On the Noiad, you are right, no NPC has ever been published beyond those nameless who attacked Captian-Archon Kliest ship in Lasombra Trilogy.<br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T12:03:48-07:00","id":1327032,"title":"","content":"Wilhelmina Harker","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Hecata are a sect not a clan.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24211-frontline989","name":"Frontline989","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T12:52:21-07:00","id":1327044,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_contain