-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327045#post1327045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Lucita et Maria Sandoza (and contrary to <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps\">CTPhipps</a></b>, I enjoy her more since her beginnings in the Sabbat, and because I enjoy seing her claiming the mantle of dear papa Moncada, albeit reluctantly)<br /> -Beatrice l\u2019Angou, one of my favorite NPC ever (with Lucita)<br /> -Mostly all the packs of Montreal by Night, and first among them, the Librarians ^^<br /> -Victoria Ash, because we cannot have too much of a good thing ^^<br /> -Lady Regina Blake, childe of Victoria Ash (Victorian Age Trilogy)<br /> -Djavakhi, sire of Noriz (Dark Ages Tzimisce novel)<br /> -Lambach Ruthven, 4th generation childe of the Eldest<br /> -Astrid Thomas, childe of Etrius (Encyclopaedia Vampirica)<br /> -Grimgroth, because I\u2019m certain it\u2019s one of his genius ideas that brought the SI on the Vienna\u2019s chantry of the Tremere (and as always, he must be alive and deep in the shadows surrounding one of his blunder)<br /> -Fran\u00e7ois Villon, \u00ab the act of Paris \u00bb ^^ (and well, I\u2019m french\u2026)<br /> -Eliezer de Polianco, Boukephos, Montano and Polonia, for the Lasombra<br /> -Goratrix, of course ^^<br /> -Monica Black<br /> -Vykos<br /> <br /> For most of them, it\u2019s mainly having an update as far as V5 is concerned. But for some, it\u2019s because we are lacking relevant infos ^^</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm really enjoying your list. Have to completely agree on the packs of Montreal. The book is too perfect (NPC wise), I narrow it down to the Widows pack, but every single entry of the NPC section is perfect!<br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1594,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","user":"Saga","date":". 07-23-2019, 06:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T15:40:40-07:00","id":1327084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darthpalpy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327045#post1327045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Lucita et Maria Sandoza (and contrary to <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps\">CTPhipps</a></b>, I enjoy her more since her beginnings in the Sabbat, and because I enjoy seing her claiming the mantle of dear papa Moncada, albeit reluctantly)</div> </div> </div> </div>Bad timing given what happens in 5th Edition, though.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -Victoria Ash, because we cannot have too much of a good thing ^^ </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure I want to see what happens when she cheats or tries to kill her 2400 year old husband as she seems to already be contemplating in the Camarilla.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -Lambach Ruthven, 4th generation childe of the Eldest </div> </div> </div>Join the Camarilla!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -Fran\u00e7ois Villon, \u00ab the act of Paris \u00bb ^^ (and well, I\u2019m french\u2026) </div> </div> </div>FYI - He showed up in LA by Night recently.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -Monica Black </div> </div> </div>Ditto!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T18:04:15-07:00","id":1327098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327084#post1327084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Bad timing given what happens in 5th Edition, though.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Maria Sandoza is still out there, plus she is not the only childe of Ambrosio Luis Mon\u00e7ada, there's a previous childer than Lucia named Fulgencio d'Idalia.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327084#post1327084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not sure I want to see what happens when she cheats or tries to kill her 2400 year old husband as she seems to already be contemplating in the Camarilla.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Last time I checked, she was in Savannah being killed by Okulos (though Ari Marmell's Gehenna: The Final Night didn't actually happened in V5).<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327084#post1327084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> FYI - He showed up in LA by Night recently.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>As far as I know LA by Night is NOT canon.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327084#post1327084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <i>-Monica Black</i><br /> <br /> Ditto!</div> </div> </div> </div>Monica Black was decapitated in the Clan Novels (Tzimisce IIRC) and her head was delivered to Marcus Vitel during the siege. Though Cynthia Black remains (at least her death was not recalled)<br /> <br /> .- Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T18:14:06-07:00","id":1327100,"title":"","content":"Well, for Lucita, I'll see her as a light (pun intended) in the darkness for the many Lasombra who would spit in the face of a Camarilla prince, because they are Lasombra, after all, and no lapdog to any other clan, those who were too intelligent not to see that Polonia Crusade was a s...storm waiting to happen, and those whose paths forbid them to even consider joining the &quot;humane&quot; &quot;kindred&quot;. (And in those all the Lasombra mystics, because you cannot masturbate yourself every night with the power of the Abyss without staying in the side of humanity for too long).<br /> But I coud see her based in Montreal with her sister, were the more eschatological and thoughtfull ca\u00efnites are ^^ (for members of the Sword of Ca\u00efn).<br /> It would be a &quot;Status Quo 2.0&quot;, marching on the road of those who paved the way for the Sabbat at the Black Monastery. (Great ritae, less shovelheads ^^)<br /> But that's a discussion for another thread ^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7454-darthpalpy","name":"Darthpalpy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7454_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T18:30:28-07:00","id":1327107,"title":"","content":"<b>Re: Victoria Ash</b><br /> <br /> Victoria Ash is now married to Tegyrius as a way of binding the Banu Haqim to the Camarilla in what was called the <b>Vermillion Wedding</b>. She's also the primary narrator of the<b> Camarilla </b>V5 supplement.<br /> <br /> Victor Ash also made an appearance in LA By Night where she conducted a massacre of its entire guest selection as a way to end the Dead Man's Party.<br /> <br /> Isaac Abrams said this was a BIT out of character for her.<br /> <br /> <b>Re: LA By Night</b><br /> <br /> Jason Carl, current head of White Wolf development, has said it is. Mind you, that might be cheating but he is the Regent of Caine right now.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Re: Monica and Cynthia Black</b><br /> <br /> Cynthia was the one killed. Not surprising since she was part of the Tal'Mah'Ra and they were considered to be radioactive.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darthpalpy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327100#post1327100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, for Lucita, I'll see her as a light (pun intended) in the darkness for the many Lasombra who would spit in the face of a Camarilla prince, because they are Lasombra, after all, and no lapdog to any other clan, those who were too intelligent not to see that Polonia Crusade was a s...storm waiting to happen, and those whose paths forbid them to even consider joining the &quot;humane&quot; &quot;kindred&quot;. (And in those all the Lasombra mystics, because you cannot masturbate yourself every night with the power of the Abyss without staying in the side of humanity for too long).<br /> But I coud see her based in Montreal with her sister, were the more eschatological and thoughtfull ca\u00efnites are ^^ (for members of the Sword of Ca\u00efn).<br /> It would be a &quot;Status Quo 2.0&quot;, marching on the road of those who paved the way for the Sabbat at the Black Monastery. (Great ritae, less shovelheads ^^)<br /> But that's a discussion for another thread ^^</div> </div> </div> </div>Well we know how I feel about Lucita in the Sabbat.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> But yes, I consider her the embodiment of the Anarch ideology before the Anarchs existed. &quot;Bow to no one. Make no one bow to you.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-23-2019, 09:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T19:19:33-07:00","id":1327113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327107#post1327107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Re: Victoria Ash</b><br /> <br /> Victoria Ash is now married to Tegyrius as a way of binding the Banu Haqim to the Camarilla in what was called the <b>Vermillion Wedding</b>. She's also the primary narrator of the<b> Camarilla </b>V5 supplement.<br /> <br /> Victor Ash also made an appearance in LA By Night where she conducted a massacre of its entire guest selection as a way to end the Dead Man's Party.<br /> <br /> Isaac Abrams said this was a BIT out of character for her.<br /> <br /> <b>Re: LA By Night</b><br /> <br /> Jason Carl, current head of White Wolf development, has said it is. Mind you, that might be cheating but he is the Regent of Caine right now.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Re: Monica and Cynthia Black</b><br /> <br /> Cynthia was the one killed. Not surprising since she was part of the Tal'Mah'Ra and they were considered to be radioactive.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I definitely hope Lucita will become the foremost Sabbat hunter in the world. Someone to exterminate the mysterious and monstrous Sabbat that have abandoned to the Beast.<br /> <br /> Like Anatole, I was hoping she wasn't lost to the Humanitaes.<br /> <br /> That may be a lost cause, though.<br /> <br /> But yes, I consider her the embodiment of the Anarch ideology before the Anarchs existed. &quot;Bow to no one. Make no one bow to you.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Aww yeah, forgot about that one (V5 is not on my mind canon wise). Tegyrius is a contemporary of Zarathustra, Phaedyme and Dexicos. He also claims that his sire was a kindred embraced in the Second City (Cb-A revised), later in V20 we have his name (Anath), probably third after Mancheaka and ur-Shulgi.<br /> <br /> On Jason Carl's claim, I'd say PROVE IT in the upcoming books (though I believe him, huge respect for the guy... that means I have to see a humongous amount of hours of LA by Night to update my archives, and btw, Cynthia Marie would be an amazing Lucita)<br /> <br /> It is really hard for me to find about whose head Vykos delivered to Prince Vitel right now, but tomorrow I'll confirm this (honestly, I'm reading gibberish) but I always thought it was Monica. I'd really doubt Cynthia would expose herself to get caught by a crusade she knew it was coming (Black Hand membership)<br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T19:33:48-07:00","id":1327117,"title":"","content":"Well I'm a proof-reader for the re-released Clan Novels so I can tell you that they never said whether it was Cynthia or Monica in those books. So it could be either of them.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> But Marcus Vitel knew Cynthia was Black Hand, was working with the Sabbat invading his city, and probably insisted on disposing of her.<br /> <br /> And funny you should ask about Cynthia Marie as Lucita.<br /> <br /> She played Lucita in a Flashback to the French Revolution (BD Walters played Karsh).<br /> <br /> Here's her costume for it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/D-5JdW6UEAAzyo5?format=jpg&amp;name=4096x4096\" target=\"_blank\">https://pbs.twimg.com/media/D-5JdW6U...name=4096x4096</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-23-2019, 10:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T20:18:55-07:00","id":1327119,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327117#post1327117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well I'm a proof-reader for the re-released Clan Novels so I can tell you that they never said whether it was Cynthia or Monica in those books. So it could be either of them.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> But Marcus Vitel knew Cynthia was Black Hand, was working with the Sabbat invading his city, and probably insisted on disposing of her.<br /> <br /> And funny you should ask about Cynthia Marie as Lucita.<br /> <br /> She played Lucita in a Flashback to the French Revolution (BD Walters played Karsh).<br /> <br /> Here's her costume for it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/D-5JdW6UEAAzyo5?format=jpg&amp;name=4096x4096\" target=\"_blank\">https://pbs.twimg.com/media/D-5JdW6U...name=4096x4096</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, it's on! This means that you assume that it was Cynthia Black's head. IIRC Vitel felt the pain of her &quot;childe&quot; death when such head was shown. I'll try to quote it as soon as I can.<br /> <br /> And yeah, Cynthia Marie is a perfect Lucita.<br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T20:32:46-07:00","id":1327121,"title":"","content":"&quot;the full weight of the prince's childe now rested within.&quot; pg,. 262 of Clan Novel Tzimisce<br /> <br /> It was Monica Black's head.<br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://fo