e":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T21:06:47-07:00","id":1327129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saga</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327127#post1327127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Source? Remember that V20 is canon agnostic.<br /> <br /> - Saga</div> </div> </div> </div>Clan Novel: Ventrue<i>:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">\u201cThat was your childe, before, on deck, Katrina?\u201d Vitel asked.<br /> <br /> The question surprised Garlotte somewhat. Most Kindred hoarded what knowledge they\u2019d gathered about one another like a miser with a golden tooth. The question itself suggested that Vitel had assembled a dossier on Garlotte and his associates. Of course, Garlotte had done the same for Vitel. But the visiting prince\u2019s revelation of knowledge lacked any flamboyance, any sense of one-ups-manship. Strangely enough, the query seemed to be\u2026an innocent question.<br /> <br /> \u201cYes. Katrina,\u201d said Garlotte. Vitel simply nodded. His mood, reserved and polite, turned somber.<br /> <br /> \u201cI had two daughters\u2026two childer. Now\u2026?\u201d He shrugged, dropped his hands into his lap, and stared at the floor.<br /> <br /> Garlotte was again stymied. Did Vitel expect \u2026sympathy? The prince of Baltimore was much relieved when Gainesmil\u2019s familiar knock sounded at the door.</span></i><br /> <br /> I think the authors may actually have forgotten Monica Embraced Cynthia.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T21:44:52-07:00","id":1327132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327129#post1327129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Clan Novel: Ventrue<i>:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">\u201cThat was your childe, before, on deck, Katrina?\u201d Vitel asked.<br /> <br /> The question surprised Garlotte somewhat. Most Kindred hoarded what knowledge they\u2019d gathered about one another like a miser with a golden tooth. The question itself suggested that Vitel had assembled a dossier on Garlotte and his associates. Of course, Garlotte had done the same for Vitel. But the visiting prince\u2019s revelation of knowledge lacked any flamboyance, any sense of one-ups-manship. Strangely enough, the query seemed to be\u2026an innocent question.<br /> <br /> \u201cYes. Katrina,\u201d said Garlotte. Vitel simply nodded. His mood, reserved and polite, turned somber.<br /> <br /> \u201cI had two daughters\u2026two childer. Now\u2026?\u201d He shrugged, dropped his hands into his lap, and stared at the floor.<br /> <br /> Garlotte was again stymied. Did Vitel expect \u2026sympathy? The prince of Baltimore was much relieved when Gainesmil\u2019s familiar knock sounded at the door.</span></i><br /> <br /> I think the authors may actually have forgotten Monica Embraced Cynthia.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Again.<br /> <br /> Source. Page. Book?<br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-23T21:48:42-07:00","id":1327133,"title":"","content":"The words Clan Novel: Ventrue at the top should give you a clue.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-24T17:40:14-07:00","id":1327300,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1326793-so-which-npc-would-you-like-to-get-more-canon-info-on?p=1327133#post1327133\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The words Clan Novel: Ventrue at the top should give you a clue.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Vitel might thought they got both, but Cynthia Black had Black Hand membership, only one head was delivered to him and he knew who she was. Hope V5 cover this intrigue.<br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-24T19:40:30-07:00","id":1327336,"title":"","content":"Elizabeth Dimitros, Hesha's childe from Clan Novel: Setite and a sadly under-explored bit part in Clan Novel: Ravnos.<br /> <br /> At the end of the latter, she gets that archaeologist to drive her away after narrowly getting her freedom, and is never seen again.<br /> <br /> Granted, knowing Elizabeth, I doubt she'd want anything to do with the Jyhad, both because vampirism disgusts her and because she needed to get away from any Setites who might report her presence to Hesha. (She's not aware that, for some reason, Hesha seemed to want her to unlive, despite specifically embracing her as &quot;an offering to Ra&quot;. The complex relationship between Hesha and Elizabeth also merits exploration). I don't expect Miss Dimitros to want to be around vampires.<br /> <br /> But I'd still like to see what she did from that moment. Where did she go? How did she establish a stable feeding method? When did she first discover Serpentis, and how does it make her feel to know that &quot;Set's blessing&quot; is with her, whether she embraces Hesha's Dark God or not? Does she continue doing anthropological work, now with the understanding that supernatural beings exist and could be found in the historical record? Would she start learning about Noddism or Typhonism, if for no other reason than to academically understand the roots of vampiric mythology in general and her own &quot;Clan&quot;'s mythology in specific?<br /> <br /> Did she become Autarkis? Anarch? If she's an Anarch, how would she respond to a whole bunch of her &quot;Clan-mates&quot; suddenly showing up, wanting a seat at the table? If she didn't go Anarch, would she seek some other path? Inconnu? Would she try to become the world's first Setite-blooded Child of Osiris?<br /> <br /> As you can see, there's so many ways you could go with this character, and instead we have...nothing.<br /> <br /> A while back, I was tempted to write my own fanfiction exploring Elizabeth's post-Clan Novel journey. I might need to consider that again.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: Oh, right, there's also the matter of Elizabeth Dimitros being a <i>fucking seer</i>. I think that also deserves another look.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":6156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","user":"Bluecho","date":". 07-24-2019, 10:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-26T14:30:25-07:00","id":1327650,"title":"","content":"Parvati!!!<br /> <br /> Loved that character from Caine's Chosen. I always considered her a childe of Bindusara.<br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-26T18:43:24-07:00","id":1327673,"title":"","content":"Also, Garwood Marshall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"}